{{!
    @template mod_thesesynthesis/select

    Liste déroulante au balisage de html_writer::select() (voir \mod_thesesynthesis\output\select_context).
    Sur une ligne, sans saut de ligne final : le partiel est inclus entre des éléments en ligne.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name, id, class Attributs de la liste.
    * options Options : value, label, selected.

    Example context (json):
    {"name": "status", "id": "menustatus", "class": "select custom-select custom-select mr-2 mb-1", "options": [
        {"value": "-999", "label": "Tous les statuts", "selected": true},
        {"value": "100", "label": "Dossier clos", "selected": false}
    ]}
}}
<select class="{{class}}" id="{{id}}" name="{{name}}">{{#options}}<option{{#selected}} selected="selected"{{/selected}} value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/options}}</select>